WEBVTT

00:02:29.911 --> 00:02:31.570
to the superficial art world.

00:02:31.594 --> 00:02:32.967
(Laughter)

00:02:32.991 --> 00:02:36.426
I decided to live my life
as a work of art.

00:02:38.178 --> 00:02:41.071
I spend hours, sometimes
months, making things.

00:02:41.807 --> 00:02:45.196
My go-to tool is a safety pin,
like this --

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.226
(Laughter)

00:02:46.250 --> 00:02:47.478
They're never big enough.

00:02:47.502 --> 00:02:48.609
(Laughter)

00:02:48.633 --> 00:02:51.157
And I use my fabrics time and time again,

00:02:51.181 --> 00:02:53.054
so I recycle everything that I use.

00:02:54.580 --> 00:02:57.590
When I get dressed I'm guided
by color, texture and shape.

00:02:58.848 --> 00:03:00.203
I rarely have a theme.